1
00:00:00,337 --> 00:00:03,797
(Amy:)Thank you. Wait...
Where'd the painting go?

2
00:00:04,466 --> 00:00:07,506
- It's right over there.
- Why?

3
00:00:09,096 --> 00:00:12,136
l have no idea. That is weird.

4
00:00:14,518 --> 00:00:15,728
(Amy:)You hate it.

5
00:00:15,936 --> 00:00:19,816
- No, no, no. It's just... It's a little big.
- l feel like an idiot.

6
00:00:20,023 --> 00:00:22,363
(Penny:)You're not an idiot.
Just help me put it back up.

7
00:00:22,568 --> 00:00:24,528
(Amy:)So you can just take it down
when I leave?

8
00:00:24,736 --> 00:00:26,946
- l don't need your pity.
- Oh, Amy, come on.

9
00:00:27,155 --> 00:00:30,285
(Amy:)I'm just glad
l didn't go for the sculpture.

10
00:00:34,371 --> 00:00:36,791
Ahh. The spoils.

11
00:00:36,999 --> 00:00:38,499
l see why victors love them.

12
00:00:40,168 --> 00:00:42,508
(Raj:)I'm happy for you, Sheldon,
but I have to admit...

13
00:00:42,713 --> 00:00:44,673
(Raj:)...I'm going to miss
sharing an office with you.

14
00:00:44,882 --> 00:00:46,172
(Sheldon:)Oh, of course you are.

15
00:00:46,383 --> 00:00:48,093
Well, feel free to drop by any time.

16
00:00:48,302 --> 00:00:50,302
- Thank you.
- Yeah. Call first.

17
00:00:56,894 --> 00:01:00,024
(Rothman:)Oh, hello.

